# ---- Binaries ----
# Game jars, mod jars, the merged base and the runtime carriers are all either
# downloaded or regenerated by run/build-merged-base.sh + run/assemble-*.sh.
# 1.7 GB of this tree is binaries; ~5.6 MB is source.
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.zip
*.dylib
*.so
*.dll
*-natives/

# ---- Reference material — NOT part of this Apache-2.0 clean-room project ----
# FML/ holds 257 genuine LGPL net.minecraftforge.fml source files. Keeping it
# out of this repository's history is what preserves the clean-room provenance
# the whole project depends on. Same for the upstream fabric-loader checkout.
/FML/
/fabric-loader/

